The '''Dual-Headed Blade''' is a {{Rare}} [[sword]].

Despite its unique appearance and high price, it is not recommended to buy, as saving up for the [[Bisento]] is much more beneficial.

==Obtainment==
The Dual-Headed Blade can be bought for {{Money|400,000}} from the [[Master Sword Dealer]], who is located on the fourth island of the [[Skylands]] in the [[First Sea]].

